# A backup of the credentials file is still the credentials file. Untracked is not
# enough: one `git add .` commits it permanently, and this org has a leak still
# unresolved with GitHub support since 2026-08-24. Added 2026-09-02.
Credentials.txt.bak-*
docs/Credentials.txt.bak-*
*.bak-*-before-*
